                    text: _("If you had told me at the start of our journey the price I was to pay in blood, I do not know if I would have had the strength to take that first step. I suppose I should have known that my friends would not let me confront Yechnagoth alone. But I would gladly give up my life today if I could bring Jarl back. He left his homeland to fight faithfully by my side, and then to lose him at the end... I wish I could go back and do it all over again."),
                  },
